  "content": "<h1>沉浸式优化</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>一种实体tick调度器，可大幅减少实体的延迟（性能提升约200%）和资源需求。</p>\n<p>与类似项目不同，本模组不会完全禁用tick，允许农场或远处的实体继续正常运行。</p>\n<p>与“实体剔除”模组配合使用效果极佳。</p>\n<h2>Discord</h2>\n<p>\n尽管经过充分测试，但仍可能存在一些粗糙之处。请在\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上报告任何问题。\n</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>逐渐降低实体和方块实体的tick速率</li>\n<li>将更新分散到多个tick中，以平滑延迟峰值</li>\n<li>根据服务器负载动态调整tick速率</li>\n<li>配置命令 (<code>/io ...</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>已测试的整合包</h2>\n<p>具体数值会根据情况变化，但我观察到：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cobblemon 1.20.1 Fabric 版本性能提升150%</li>\n<li>包含700个模组的私人整合包性能提升330%（画廊示例）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img width=\"547\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=547,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/screenshots/speed.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<h1>沉浸式合集</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=171524e841d667de68a7e86506eed0b7\" alt=\"页面哈希值，便于页面部署。\"></p>",
